{"id":"bd7acd1192e46962","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-theory-properties.md","title":"Consistency, Completeness, Closure of Theory","display":"df-theory-properties — Consistency, Completeness, Closure of Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-theory-properties","aliases":["17-df-theory-properties"],"display":"df-theory-properties — Consistency, Completeness, Closure of Theory","depends_on":["[[17-df-sentence]]","[[17-df-sentence-truth]]","[[17-df-model]]"],"source_section":"1.3; 1.4","source_result":"consistency via Extended Completeness; completeness/closure conventions","source_pages_print":[25,33,36,37],"source_pages_djvu":[41,49,52,53],"source_verification":"statement-compared; local equivalent formulation","label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-df-1.1.13","local_revision":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-theory-properties"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-theory-properties</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-theory-properties — Consistency, Completeness, Closure of Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"528afa8a8db7f8be\" href=\"?note=528afa8a8db7f8be\" title=\"17-df-sentence-truth\">17-df-sentence-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"1.3; 1.4"},{"key":"source_result","html":"consistency via Extended Completeness; completeness/closure conventions"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>25</span><span>33</span><span>36</span><span>37</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>41</span><span>49</span><span>52</span><span>53</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; local equivalent formulation"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-1.1.13"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>。所有理论谓词以此语言为固定参数；不同语言的调用必须分别实例化。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\)</span> (model class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\sigma\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\sigma\\)</span> (truth of a sentence in a structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"528afa8a8db7f8be\" href=\"?note=528afa8a8db7f8be\" title=\"17-df-sentence-truth\">17-df-sentence-truth</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Consistent},\\operatorname{Complete},\\operatorname{Closed}\">\\(\\operatorname{Consistent},\\operatorname{Complete},\\operatorname{Closed}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cn}\\)</span> (semantic-consequence closure defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\nT\\models\\sigma\n&amp;\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n(\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\sigma),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Cn}(T)\n&amp;\\;=\\;\n\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L:T\\models\\sigma\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Consistent}(T)\n&amp;\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\neq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Complete}(T)\n&amp;\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{Consistent}(T)\\land\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\;\n(T\\models\\sigma\\lor T\\models\\neg\\sigma),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Closed}(T)\n&amp;\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{Cn}(T)=T.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\nT\\models\\sigma\n&amp;\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n(\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\sigma),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Cn}(T)\n&amp;\\;=\\;\n\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L:T\\models\\sigma\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Consistent}(T)\n&amp;\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\neq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Complete}(T)\n&amp;\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{Consistent}(T)\\land\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\;\n(T\\models\\sigma\\lor T\\models\\neg\\sigma),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Closed}(T)\n&amp;\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{Cn}(T)=T.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Completeness is stated semantically and does not silently assume that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> already\ncontains all of its consequences.  Closure is recorded separately by\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Closed}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Closed}(T)\\)</span>.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence-truth","status":"resolved","id":"528afa8a8db7f8be","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ ($T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$, see [[17-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ (model class, see [[17-df-model]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence-truth","status":"resolved","id":"528afa8a8db7f8be","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\sigma$ (truth of a sentence in a structure, see [[17-df-sentence-truth]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Consistent},\\operatorname{Complete},\\operatorname{Closed}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cn}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\nT\\models\\sigma\n&\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n(\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\sigma),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Cn}(T)\n&\\;=\\;\n\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L:T\\models\\sigma\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Consistent}(T)\n&\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\neq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Complete}(T)\n&\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{Consistent}(T)\\land\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\;\n(T\\models\\sigma\\lor T\\models\\neg\\sigma),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Closed}(T)\n&\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{Cn}(T)=T.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Closed}(T)","display":false}],"bytes":2173,"backlinks":[{"id":"caf79552cf044fde","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T_{\\mathrm{DLO}}$ 见 [[17-df-dense-linear-order]]；$\\operatorname{Complete}$ 见 [[17-df-theory-properties]]，解释语言为 $L_{<}$。"},{"id":"d8be86fc3e901d60","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Complete}$ (theory-completeness predicate, see [[17-df-theory-properties]])"},{"id":"fcb7beff59d6f9fd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Complete}$ (theory-completeness predicate, see [[17-df-theory-properties]])"},{"id":"31695c838dded93c","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T,T^*\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，$\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L$ 见 [[17-df-model-companion]]。\n$\\operatorname{Mod}$ 见 [[17-df-model]]，$L(\\mathfrak A)$ 及 $\\operatorname{Diag}(\\mathfrak A)$ 见 [[17-df-diagram]]。\n对每个 $\\mathfrak A\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$，把 $T^*$ 的句子按同一字符串包含进 $L(\\mathfrak A)$；$\\operatorname{Complete}(T^*\\cup\\operatorname{Diag}(\\mathfrak A))$ 是 [[17-df-theory-properties]] 的完全性谓词在语言 $L(\\mathfrak A)$ 的实例，包含可满足性。\n以下定义 $\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L(T^*,T)$，参数次序与模型伴随相同。"},{"id":"0626faf5263e31f8","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Complete}$ (theory-completeness predicate, see [[17-df-theory-properties]])"},{"id":"e6a4ebf476ad2f6d","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Complete}$ (theory-completeness predicate, see [[17-df-theory-properties]])"},{"id":"a09db7c2dab60d0a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Complete}$ (theory-completeness predicate, see [[17-df-theory-properties]])"},{"id":"29c30973fd2ffd89","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T$ 是可数语言 $L$ 的完全理论；$\\operatorname{Complete}$ 见 [[17-df-theory-properties]]，$|L|$ 见 [[17-df-language-cardinality]]。"},{"id":"a2084db1d8bf7af0","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T$ 是可数语言 $L$ 的完全理论，$\\operatorname{Complete}$ 见 [[17-df-theory-properties]]；$|L|$ 见 [[17-df-language-cardinality]]。"},{"id":"1bb6e1781f34c54a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。$\\operatorname{UniversalSent}_L$ 见 [[17-df-universal-theory]]；$T\\models\\sigma$ 是 [[17-df-theory-properties]] 的语义后承，均在语言 $L$ 中解释。\n以下定义集合 $T_\\forall$ 与二元谓词 $\\operatorname{Cotheory}_L(T,U)$。"},{"id":"a628b44ab2781524","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。$|L|$ 与 $\\aleph_0$ 见 [[17-df-language-cardinality]]；$\\operatorname{Complete}$ 见 [[17-df-theory-properties]]；$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ 见 [[17-df-model]]。$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-type]]；$\\models_T$ 与 $\\operatorname{Complete}_{T,n}$ 见 [[17-df-complete-formula]]；$\\operatorname{Atomic}_T$ 见 [[17-df-atomic-model]]。实现公式集谓词 $\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]。证明使用 [[17-df-local-omission]] 的局部省略及 [[17-thm-extended-omitting-types]]。"},{"id":"49c16a998c61a1e3","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\models$ (semantic consequence, see [[17-df-theory-properties]])"},{"id":"f66dca8adb2ce568","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ ($L$-theory, see [[17-df-theory-properties]])"},{"id":"7a9661711dbc540e","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。$|L|$ 与 $\\aleph_0$ 见 [[17-df-language-cardinality]]；$\\operatorname{Complete}$ 见 [[17-df-theory-properties]]；$S_n(T)$ 见 [[17-df-type]]；$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ 见 [[17-df-model]]。$m:\\omega\\to\\omega$，$(p_n)_{n\\in\\omega}$ 为公式集序列。$\\operatorname{Realized}_{\\mathfrak A}$ 见 [[17-df-type-realization]]，$\\operatorname{NonIsolated}_T$ 见 [[17-df-non-isolated-types]]；两接口均在内部绑定有限元数。一般公式集的实现及局部省略见 [[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]、[[17-df-local-omission]]，证明使用 [[17-thm-extended-omitting-types]]。"},{"id":"400a658908591f62","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，语言大小 $|L|$ 见 [[17-df-language-cardinality]]，$\\aleph_0$ 为最小无限基数。$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 见 [[17-df-sentence]]；一致性谓词 $\\operatorname{Consistent}$ 与模型类 $\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ 见 [[17-df-theory-properties]]、[[17-df-model]]。$m:\\omega\\to\\omega$，$(\\Sigma_r)_{r\\in\\omega}$ 为公式集序列，且每个 $\\Sigma_r\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{L,m(r)}$，见 [[17-df-type]]。局部省略与模型省略分别取 [[17-df-local-omission]] 和 [[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]；$\\operatorname{card}(X)$ 为集合基数。"},{"id":"a79cd0c61a8bf7df","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Consistent},\\operatorname{Complete}$ (consistency and completeness, see [[17-df-theory-properties]])"},{"id":"d868412e4c7fb403","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T,T^*\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$；$\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L$、$\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L$ 分别见 [[17-df-model-companion]]、[[17-df-model-completion]]。\n$\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L(T)$ 使用 [[17-df-embedding-amalgamation]] 的普通嵌入。证明中图示和完全性分别取 [[17-df-diagram]]、[[17-df-theory-properties]] 的扩张语言实例；使用 [[17-lem-universal-consequences-extension]] 及 [[17-thm-compactness]] 的紧致性。完全理论的两个任意模型的初等联合嵌入在下文直接由紧致性论证。"},{"id":"999ba89711dbb01a","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Complete}$ (theory-completeness predicate, see [[17-df-theory-properties]])"},{"id":"d80c11bad8de8c05","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Complete}$ (theory-completeness predicate, see [[17-df-theory-properties]])"},{"id":"6738c8e9f2e3c32e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Complete}$ (theory-completeness predicate, see [[17-df-theory-properties]])"},{"id":"d7469176894ed5c8","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Complete}$ (semantic completeness predicate, see [[17-df-theory-properties]])"},{"id":"c033869601b29cc8","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Consistent}$ and $\\models$ (consistency and semantic consequence, see [[17-df-theory-properties]])"},{"id":"2dcdcb6f0159c6a5","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Complete}(T)$ (complete-theory predicate, see [[17-df-theory-properties]])"},{"id":"979cffef60954613","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Consistent}$ and $\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ (consistency and models, see [[17-df-theory-properties]] and [[17-df-model]])"},{"id":"1427940d1339037e","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\models$ (semantic consequence, see [[17-df-theory-properties]])"},{"id":"c4b7235ff061d6ae","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Complete}$ (theory-completeness predicate, see [[17-df-theory-properties]])"},{"id":"3c63f574159f6fcd","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Complete}$ (theory-completeness predicate, see [[17-df-theory-properties]])"},{"id":"13c73c6f79ee78a7","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-theory-properties]]"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-137","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-aleph-one-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-aleph-zero-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]\n[[17-df-assignment]]\n[[17-df-assignment-predicate]]\n[[17-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model-notation]]\n[[17-df-bool-comb]]\n[[17-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-expansion]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-relation]]\n[[17-df-bound-variable]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]\n[[17-df-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-chain-union]]\n[[17-df-chain-union-preservation]]\n[[17-df-complete-formula]]\n[[17-df-deduction-system]]\n[[17-df-definable-closure]]\n[[17-df-definable-set]]\n[[17-df-dense-linear-order]]\n[[17-df-diagram]]\n[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation]]\n[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation-property]]\n[[17-df-elementary-chain]]\n[[17-df-elementary-diagram]]\n[[17-df-elementary-embedding]]\n[[17-df-elementary-equivalence]]\n[[17-df-elementary-extension]]\n[[17-df-elementary-substructure]]\n[[17-df-embedding]]\n[[17-df-embedding-amalgamation]]\n[[17-df-e